; ASA-CF08 / 0.5 mm Bozzle / Klipper Voron 2.4
; Paired with README.md. Verify physically installed nozzle before running.
; Adapted from CNC Kitchen's weighed extrusion benchmark (see README).
; Left-to-right columns: 270 C, 275 C, 280 C; Y ascends front to back.
; Each weighed blob is 200 mm filament in two consecutive 100 mm Z/E moves.
SAVE_GCODE_STATE NAME=ASA_CF08_WEIGHED_FLOW
G90
M83
M220 S100
M221 S100
SET_GCODE_OFFSET Z=0
BED_MESH_CLEAR
M107
M104 S150
M190 S100
G28
QUAD_GANTRY_LEVEL
M104 S150
TEMPERATURE_WAIT SENSOR=extruder MINIMUM=145 MAXIMUM=150
CARTOGRAPHER_TOUCH_HOME
BED_MESH_CALIBRATE ADAPTIVE=0
G90
M83
G0 Z22 F600

; 270 C column
M109 S270
G4 P20000

